  "releaseNotes": "STAF.LLMEval 3.0.0 — Architecture & Ecosystem\n\n- Multi-package: STAF.LLMEval (meta) → Core + Abstractions; TypeForwards for BC\n- Providers: Claude, Groq, Mistral (+ existing OpenAI / Azure / Gemini / Ollama)\n- Optional STAF.LLMEval.SemanticKernel package\n- ASP.NET Core helper: AddLLMEval(IConfiguration)\n\nSee https://github.com/sooraj171/LLMEval/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
